      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        126.91712188720703,
        526.8958129882812,
        140.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": "details of studies included in the current analysis ( Web Annex A.10: Review of the diagnostic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.954405784606934,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        142.6041259765625,
        527.1182861328125,
        155.48512268066406
      ],
      "text": "accuracy of targeted NGS technologies for detection of drug resistance among people",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        157.9171142578125,
        181.06800842285156,
        171.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": "); diagnosed with TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        173.4171142578125,
        78.81920623779297,
        186.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81920623779297,
        173.4171142578125,
        524.400390625,
        186.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "a summary of the results and details of the evidence quality assessment ( Web Annex A.10:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.994248390197754,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        188.9171142578125,
        526.961669921875,
        202.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": ");  GRADE profiles of targeted next-generation sequencing for detection of TB drug resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        204.4171142578125,
        104.03630065917969,
        217.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.9171142578125,
        78.81909942626953,
        233.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        219.9171142578125,
        526.962158203125,
        233.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": "a summary of the GDG panel judgements ( Web Annex A.10:  Evidence to decision tables:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        235.4171142578125,
        439.6626892089844,
        248.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "). targeted next-generation sequencing for detection of TB drug resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        263.7633361816406,
        246.438720703125,
        280.143310546875
      ],
      "text": "Cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        290.394287109375,
        526.9826049804688,
        303.539306640625
      ],
      "text": "The cost and cost–effectiveness data for targeted NGS were assessed through a systematic",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        305.894287109375,
        526.9653930664062,
        319.039306640625
      ],
      "text": "review of the published literature and a generalized model-based cost–effectiveness analysis",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.3941955566406,
        188.091796875,
        334.5392150878906
      ],
      "text": "commissioned by WHO.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.3982238769531,
        527.1803588867188,
        358.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "The systematic review on the cost and cost–effectiveness of using either targeted NGS or WGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99804973602295,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        360.8982238769531,
        526.9479370117188,
        374.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "to diagnose DR-TB searched three databases: PubMed, Embase and Scopus. The search was",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.3982238769531,
        526.9579467773438,
        389.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "run on 30 October 2022 and had no time restriction. All costing data were inflated to 2021 US",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        391.8982238769531,
        527.0270385742188,
        405.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "dollars. Findings were synthesized descriptively, given the considerable degree of heterogeneity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.949383735656738,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        407.3982238769531,
        526.9698486328125,
        420.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "in study methodology and outcomes. Among the studies included in the systematic review,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        422.8982238769531,
        526.9041137695312,
        436.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "three were on targeted NGS only, three were on targeted NGS and WGS, and four were on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.3982238769531,
        526.93701171875,
        451.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "WGS only. For targeted NGS based on a single study (n=1), the cost per sample was between",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.8982238769531,
        527.0339965820312,
        467.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "US$ 69.64 for Illumina MiSeq on 24 samples, and US$ 73.47 for Nanopore MinION on 12",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.3982238769531,
        526.9149169921875,
        482.5432434082031
      ],
      "text": "samples; however, this costing was limited to only some components and did not include",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        484.8982238769531,
        526.93505859375,
        498.0432434082031
      ],
      "text": "human resource costs or overhead costs. For WGS (n=5), cost per sample ranged from US$ 63.00",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.945465087890625,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        500.3982238769531,
        527.1088256835938,
        513.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "on Nanopore MinION to US$ 277.00 on Illumina MiSeq; given that studies used an inconsistent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.974420547485352,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        515.898193359375,
        526.958984375,
        529.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "number of component costs, comparisons were challenging. Based on the review, the most",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        531.398193359375,
        526.9645385742188,
        544.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "significant cost component was the sequencing step, and the largest component costs were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.898193359375,
        526.9920043945312,
        560.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "reagents and consumables, including those necessary for sequencing, sample processing and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.398193359375,
        526.9584350585938,
        575.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "targeted NGS steps library preparation. Study authors identified four major cost drivers: use of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995999336242676,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.898193359375,
        526.9655151367188,
        591.043212890625
      ],
      "text": "different sequencers, depth and breadth of coverage, inefficiencies in initial sample runs, and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        593.398193359375,
        315.8360595703125,
        606.543212890625
      ],
      "text": "economies of scale via batching or cross-batching.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        615.9022216796875,
        526.8930053710938,
        629.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "The cost data from the systematic review were limited; therefore, an empirical unit costing",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.9022216796875,
        526.9261474609375,
        643.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "was performed, in consultation with manufacturers and FIND. At the time of this work, only",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        643.9022216796875,
        527.003173828125,
        657.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "pricing for Deeplex Myc-TB was available and it was used for estimation of cost for the class.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        657.9022216796875,
        526.96435546875,
        671.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "Unit costs included consumables, equipment, staffing and overheads (where available); also,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.9022216796875,
        526.9700317382812,
        685.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "costs assumed targeted NGS testing for all drugs. Based on the empirical analysis, the cost of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.9022216796875,
        241.89151000976562,
        699.0472412109375
      ],
      "text": "targeted NGS was estimated to be:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        705.6541137695312,
        78.81909942626953,
        718.7991333007812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        705.6541137695312,
        260.2995910644531,
        718.7991333007812
      ],
      "text": "US$ 134 to US$ 257 in South Africa;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        721.1541137695312,
        78.81909942626953,
        734.2991333007812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        721.1541137695312,
        260.6652526855469,
        734.2991333007812
      ],
      "text": "US$ 120 to US$ 198 in Georgia; and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        736.6541137695312,
        78.81909942626953,
        749.7991333007812
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        736.6541137695312,
        224.1101837158203,
        749.7991333007812
      ],
      "text": "US$ 121 to US$ 175 in India.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
